g core to constitutional proline under ambient aqueous hydrolysis.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_009\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_006\", \"mol_007\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P2\",\n      \"name\": \"Direct 3-aminopropanal entry with geothermal hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"Uses the same supported cyanosulfidic core as P1 but finishes in a warmer geothermal surface pool to accelerate the hydrolysis bottleneck.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_006\", \"mol_007\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P3\",\n      \"name\": \"Acrolein ammoniation entry with ambient hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"Acrolein is first converted to 3-aminopropanal, then the network merges into the experimentally supported Patel core and ends with ambient nitrile hydrolysis.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_009\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P4\",\n      \"name\": \"Acrolein ammoniation entry with geothermal hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"Same as P3 but with the warm-surface hydrolysis variant to reduce the kinetic burden of nitrile hydrolysis.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P5\",\n      \"name\": \"Glycerol dehydration entry with ambient hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"A hotter dry-down feeder converts glycerol to acrolein, which is aminated to 3-aminopropanal before entering the common cyanosulfidic proline backbone and ambient hydrolysis endpoint.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_002\", \"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_009\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P6\",\n      \"name\": \"Glycerol dehydration entry with geothermal hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"The glycerol-to-acrolein feeder is combined with the warm hydrolysis branch, giving a fully surface-based path that uses both hot dry-down and hot aqueous stages.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_002\", \"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P7\",\n      \"name\": \"3-Hydroxypropanal dehydration entry with ambient hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"A speculative but chemically conservative C3 feeder dehydrates 3-hydroxypropanal to acrolein, then converges through 3-aminopropanal into the Patel core and ambient hydrolysis.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_003\", \"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_009\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P8\",\n      \"name\": \"3-Hydroxypropanal dehydration entry with geothermal hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"The speculative 3-hydroxypropanal feeder is paired with the warmer hydrolysis endpoint while keeping the same cyanosulfidic ring-forming core.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_003\", \"rxn_001\", \"rxn_005\", \"rxn_006\", \"rxn_007\", \"rxn_008\", \"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_011\", \"mol_005\", \"mol_009\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P9\",\n      \"name\": \"Malondialdehyde reductive amination entry with ambient hydrolysis\",\n      \"description\": \"A speculative sulfidic reductive amination feeder generates 3-aminopropanal from malondialdehyde, then the route joins the experimentally supported surface core an